#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid "That file nests more than %(limit)s levels deep, so it was not read."
msgstr "Dee Fichier ass méi wéi %(limit)s Niveauen déif verschachtelt, also gouf en net gelies."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That is not a Europass file. Postulo reads the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you, the XML attached to it, and the older Europass XML and JSON; this is none of them."
msgstr "Dat ass kee Europass-Fichier. De Postulo liest de PDF, deen europass.europa.eu Iech gëtt, den XML, deen drun hänkt, an déi méi al Europass-XML- a -JSON-Fichieren; dëst ass keen dovun."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That PDF has files attached to it, and none of them is a Europass CV. Upload the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you, as it is."
msgstr "Un deem PDF hänke Fichieren, mä keen dovun ass en Europass-CV. Luet de PDF erop, deen europass.europa.eu Iech gëtt, esou wéi en ass."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That PDF has nothing attached to it, so there is no Europass CV inside it to read. The PDF europass.europa.eu gives you carries the CV as an attached file, and a PDF printed or saved again by another program loses it: download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr "Un deem PDF hänkt näischt, also ass keen Europass-CV dran ze liesen. De PDF, deen europass.europa.eu Iech gëtt, dréit de CV als ugehaangene Fichier, an e PDF, deen en anere Programm nach eng Kéier gedréckt oder gespäichert huet, verléiert en: luet de CV nach eng Kéier vun europass.europa.eu erof a luet dee Fichier esou erop, wéi en ass."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That PDF is encrypted, so the Europass CV attached to it cannot be read. Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr "Dee PDF ass verschlësselt, dofir kann den Europass-CV, deen drun hänkt, net gelies ginn. Luet de CV nach eng Kéier vun europass.europa.eu erof a luet dee Fichier esou erop, wéi en ass."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "That XML is not a Europass CV. Postulo reads the XML europass.europa.eu writes (a Candidate) and that of the Europass editor before it (a SkillsPassport); this is neither."
msgstr "Dësen XML ass keen Europass-CV. De Postulo liest den XML, deen europass.europa.eu schreift (e Candidate), an deen vum fréieren Europass-Editeur (e SkillsPassport); dëst ass keen dovun."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The European CV format: the PDF europass.europa.eu gives you and the XML attached to it, and the older XML and JSON of the Europass service before it."
msgstr "Den europäesche CV-Format: de PDF, deen europass.europa.eu Iech gëtt, an den XML, deen drun hänkt, an déi méi al XML- a JSON-Formater vum fréiere Europass-Déngscht."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "The file attached to that PDF is damaged and could not be unpacked. Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr "De Fichier, deen un deem PDF hänkt, ass beschiedegt a konnt net ausgepaakt ginn. Luet de CV nach eng Kéier vun europass.europa.eu erof a luet dee Fichier esou erop, wéi en ass."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy, python-format
msgid "The file attached to that PDF is packed in a way Postulo does not read (%(filter)s). Download the CV again from europass.europa.eu and upload that file as it is."
msgstr "De Fichier, deen un deem PDF hänkt, ass op eng Manéier gepaakt, déi de Postulo net liest (%(filter)s). Luet de CV nach eng Kéier vun europass.europa.eu erof a luet dee Fichier esou erop, wéi en ass."

#: src/postulo/plugins/europass/reader.py
#, fuzzy, python-format
